WEBVTT

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.010
Sonic!

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:10.410
Revolver...

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.750
Spike!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.960
<i>Two on one is a bad situation.</i>

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:19.180
<i>Although...</i>

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.460
Alchemic Chain!

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:27.680
You can't hit me!

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.810
Of course I can't!
I'm not trying to hit you!

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:33.770
I'm positioning you to get shot down!

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.860
Nice, Caro-san!

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.110
Goliath!

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:41.020
Purge Blast!

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:45.550
Rocket Punch!

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:50.320
No way!

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:53.920
Direct hit!

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.750
V for victory!

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:08.560
There, Caro's knocked out
and Corona-chan is captured.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.270
Nanoha-san?! How long have you...

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:14.280
It's dangerous to assume that you've won.

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.270
That's the law of the battlefield!

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.550
Okay, now's the time...

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.880
Blaster One!

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:26.920
<i>I don't have much magical power left...</i>

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:31.360
<i>so with Multi-Raid, I'll take them all out!</i>

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:35.450
Nanoha-san has started focusing!

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:38.420
To any red team survivors!

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:42.410
Nanoha-san is charging a wide-area bombardment!

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:44.300
Get as far away as you can!

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:48.560
I'll use Multi-Raid to annihilate
the other team's remaining power...

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:51.720
and cancel out Teana's Breaker!

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:02.010
Mode: Multi-Raid...

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:05.380
Shift: Phantom Strike...

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:10.750
Starlight Breaker!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:32.110
I-Is that the end of it?

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:36.690
Well, when two Breakers collide,
you would think so.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:39.220
How is everyone?

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.580
Somehow, I survived.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:03.800
There's me and... two others left.

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:07.250
One of them is coming here.
At that speed, is it Subaru?

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.470
Nope! It's Vivio!

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:12.730
No way!

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:15.270
How are you barely hurt?!

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.770
Aw, shit! They got me!

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:23.400
You little...

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:29.200
Teana-san, here I come!

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.950
I'd prefer you didn't!

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:33.990
Hegemon...

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.990
Sky Schism!

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:37.950
...temporarily.

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:46.030
Vivio-san, I won't let you take out Teana-san!

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:48.970
Sorry, Einhart!

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:51.290
I already got taken out.

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:54.470
Even I saw it that time!

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:57.020
Vivio shot something at Teana!

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:59.980
Indeed, a single Sonic Shooter.

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:06.020
Vivio-san, it appears we're the last two left.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.860
Yep! Here we go, Einhart-san!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:15.030
<i>She remembers her opponent's attacks and how to react.</i>

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.890
<i>Fast and precise movements...</i>

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:21.420
<i>Confronting attacks completely fearlessly...</i>

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:23.540
<i>This girl's fighting style is...</i>

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:28.630
<i>Counter Hitter!</i>

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:29.800
<i>Here!</i>

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:31.760
Flash Connection...

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:35.600
Axel Smash!

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:38.100
I hit h—

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.820
Okay! Match complete!

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:56.780
Hmm...
I guess it's a draw.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.410
<i>The battles after that...</i>

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:08.010
<i>varied with slightly different match-ups.</i>

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:13.830
<i>For the third one, we changed team compositions by trading.</i>

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:20.460
<i>It was so hectic and intense
that it became more than just a match...</i>

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.640
I can't lift my arms...

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.110
I can't get up!

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:37.430
I can't move...

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:39.080
Really...

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:42.450
It's because you pushed yourselves past your limits.

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:45.370
Lu-chan, how are you fine?!

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:48.710
The experienced know the pace that they can handle.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.710
<i>Even so...</i>

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:54.540
<i>These girls sure are amazing.</i>

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:58.820
Einhart-san, is something wrong?

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:02.000
No, it's nothing.

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:07.010
Which reminds me, it was Einhart's first match like this.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.260
What'd you think?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:09.560
Right...

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.900
It was very enlightening.

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:17.330
Even as a sport, magical battles can get pretty intense.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.560
Yes...

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.020
I've been considering various things.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.620
It allows you to understand your own weaknesses.

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.270
My world...

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:29.330
My perspective was much too narrow.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:34.300
If you enjoyed today's match,
then I wonder what you'll think of this...

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:38.420
The Dimension Sports Activity Association.

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:40.260
An official magical battle tournament.

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:45.350
Participants' ages range from ten to nineteen.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:49.520
It consists of magical matches
between close combat specialists.

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:55.490
It's a gathering of young mages from all of the
administrated worlds to compete for the championship.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:58.860
The Inter-Middle Championship.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:06.550
Since we qualify this year,
we thought we'd go try it out!

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:07.620
That's right!

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:14.130
It's a great place to help you understand
the real limit of your magic and martial arts.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.670
By the way, I'll be participating this year, too!

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.090
Okay, everyone!

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:24.430
We brought some sweetened nutritious drinks.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:26.870
Yay!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.950
The Inter-Middle, huh?

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:44.850
Everything will be perfect if Einhart decides to go.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.310
Looks like it.
How about it, Coach?

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:52.250
She's probably convinced after today.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:57.960
The strength she's searching for isn't
for throwing her life away or settling a grudge.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:04.180
It's to train, steadily improve herself,
and compete against opponents under fair conditions.

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:08.220
Maybe it's for conquering her opponents and herself.

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:09.140
Yeah.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:15.610
Well, if they're going to the tournament,
then I guess I need to decide on some things, too.

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:19.110
Like whether to acknowledge yourself
as the master of Vivio's group?

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:23.560
No! It's not like I'm just now
going to start acting like their master!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:26.910
I'm just going to list myself as their coach and second!

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:29.910
I'm just letting them use my name, not taking credit.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:31.250
I know.

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:35.700
I already hear them calling you "master" all the time.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.840
Well, that may be true...

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:41.050
You're still searching for your own future.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:47.090
You should try to find your own path
together with Vivio and Einhart's group.

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:48.750
Yeah.

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:53.740
The tougher kids in the Inter-Middle are actually really strong.

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:55.060
Really?

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:58.680
Wait, are there rules against stuff like Corona's golem?

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:03.030
I'm not allowed to bring one with me,
but I can assemble them on the spot.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.270
How about it, Einhart?

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:13.450
Wanna enter?

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:15.300
Uh... Well...

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:16.660
Einhart-san!

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:21.790
The tournament qualifiers are in July,
and I've still got a long way to go...

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:23.680
so I wanna become much, much stronger!

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:27.640
I want to fight you on stage in an official match!

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:34.760
Thank you, Vivio-san.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:39.570
I think I'll take on the challenge of the Inter-Middle as well.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:42.590
Right!

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:46.720
Oh, speaking of the qualifications...

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:50.520
As long as your age and fitness
aren't a problem, you're okay.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:54.500
I guess we can all write Nove in as our coach and second!

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:57.410
If Nove's your master, you should be fine.

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:58.460
Right.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.090
There's one more thing.

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:04.020
For safety purposes,
you have to equip at least a Class 3 device.

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:09.140
I... don't have a device.

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:12.510
Oh, then let's use this opportunity to have one made.

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:17.660
Um... But Ancient Belkan devices
are very difficult to make.

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:23.320
I guess you haven't realized the extent of my connections.

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:26.090
Just leave it to me!

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:28.320
O-Okay.

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:43.580
<i>His ambition and my desire...</i>

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:46.980
<i>to prove the strength of the Hegemon Style.</i>

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:53.880
<i>I don't know if this struggle will end
if I don't put my life on the line.</i>

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:00.370
Klaus...

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:04.120
If I fight there, will it be enough?

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.900
Someday, I'll catch up to you.

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:10.120
Someday, I'll surpass you.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:13.780
I'll become stronger than Olivie was on that day...

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:20.860
for the sake of fulfilling our ambition.

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.440
A third day of great weather!

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:36.270
Yeah, let's do our routine.

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:39.180
Which reminds me, thanks, Nove.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:41.220
What do you mean?

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:48.240
For stuff like inviting Einhart-san on this trip
and having us practice together.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:51.440
I was just the one who met her.

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:53.240
It was all her choice.

00:13:55.470 --> 00:14:01.670
I'm just happy that she's learning
that magical battles can be fun...

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:07.100
and that, most importantly,
you're having fun while growing strong together.

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:08.560
Yes, master!

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:11.310
I'm counting on your guidance from now on!

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:13.040
Right! Leave it to me!

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:21.520
Commander Yagami Hayate is an Administrative Knight
and is famous for various cases throughout her career.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:25.340
Ah, Lulu! Hey!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:26.940
Hey, Agito!

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:29.700
This is about the device, right?
One second...

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.210
Yes, please.

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:40.160
Oh! Hey, Lu-ko!
It's been a while!

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:44.800
Commander Yagami, it has been a while!
You're off work today, right?

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.000
Yep!

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.010
<i>This person is...</i>

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.930
Anyway, this girl is...

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:53.720
Ah, I've heard about her.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:15:01.320
She's a bit mischievous, but is currently training hard
in magical battles with Nove and Vivio's group.

00:15:01.320 --> 00:15:03.600
Sounds like an earnest kid!

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:07.520
For a girl like that, I'll do whatever I can!

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:12.610
Do you just want a device for official magical battles?

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:14.630
Have you decided on a type?

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:15.650
Yes.

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:18.470
Like a wearable type or a weapon type?

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:20.200
Feel free to request anything.

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.960
Um... Well...

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.910
I just want to participate in hand-to-hand fights.

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:27.610
I wonder what would be best for that...

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:32.510
I think a support and control type
like this one would be good.

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:37.630
I see. Then I guess we'll use
Chris's construction as the foundation.

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:40.720
We should be able to reproduce that hardware quickly.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:41.980
Sure can!

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:43.770
Is that okay, Einhart?

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:44.690
Yes!

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:48.560
Then we'll get started on the Hegemon's personal device.

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:53.030
Yagami Hayate, Rein, and Agito
will all be working diligently!

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.280
Leave it to us!

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:57.250
Thank you very much!

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:59.900
Anyway, talk to you later!

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:00.860
Okay!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:04.400
The Inter-Middle, huh?

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.720
So it's already that time of the year.

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:09.630
It's only the middle of May.
It's not time yet.

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:12.760
Aren't there some kids from around here going?

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:18.010
The ones that Zafira is teaching, right?
I wonder how many will enter.

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:24.020
Everyone's always trying their hardest.
Maybe some could become rivals with Vivio's group?

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:25.550
Yeah, they could.

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:27.650
There's one who's pretty amazing.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:29.940
I know. Miura, right?

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:31.110
Correct!

00:16:31.610 --> 00:16:36.950
She obviously practices with Zafira,
but often does with Signum and Vita, too.

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:41.840
Master, Inter-Middle applications
open starting today, right?

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:42.910
Yeah.

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:45.330
With everything you've taught me,

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:49.750
and the techniques that Vita-san, Signum-san, and Shamal-sensei have trained me in...

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:55.760
and all of the delicious snacks that Hayate-san and the others are always making for me...

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.950
I'll do my best!

00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:03.920
I'll do my best!

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:07.020
You don't need to say it twice.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.400
The Inter-Middle, huh?

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:13.000
So people will be busy starting tomorrow.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:15.230
You've gotta train hard when you get home!

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:17.600
Right, but we'll be okay!

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:21.080
Thanks to our coach making a training menu for us.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:23.490
Well, you've gotta train properly.

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:27.730
But there are quite a few kids
participating in the Inter-Middle, right?

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:31.090
Twenty participants move on from the sectional qualifiers.

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:35.870
But together with the previous champion,
it makes twenty-one.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:39.760
The tournament is a stage of dreams for those twenty-one!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:46.050
And the winner represents our world
in the interdimensional championship.

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:52.010
If you can win that championship,
you'd be the undisputed strongest in your age group.

00:17:52.560 --> 00:17:55.150
But for us, that's a very...

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:56.830
...distant future dream.

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.610
But someday, I'm sure we can!

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:03.040
Nove-san, how do you think we would do as we are now?

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:06.680
For starters, central Mid is a highly competitive area.

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:14.000
The DSAA's rules affect some abilities
more than others, so let me say this...

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:20.260
You three wouldn't get past the novice class.

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:23.970
Einhart might get to the second round of qualifiers.

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:28.070
But it'd be tough for you to advance to the elite class.

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.140
But...

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:34.290
We've still got two months, right?
Can't we improve a lot in that time?

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:37.700
Well, you never know what could happen.

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:41.820
I intend to prepare you to win.

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:45.480
We'll refine Corona's golem creation and control.

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.780
Right!

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:51.020
We'll perfect Rio's Shining Spring Fist
and flame-lightning magic.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:51.750
Right!

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:57.380
We'll improve Vivio's martial arts and
complete some secret counter blow training.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.300
Right!

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:00.380
And Einhart...

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:04.970
We'll find someone with tournament
experience for you to spar.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:09.100
They'll have picked things up in the midst
of battle that you need to know.

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.560
Thank you!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.430
I wanna spar with lots of people, too!

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:17.010
So do I!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.400
Me too!

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:22.560
You guys wait your turn!
You need to listen to your coach!

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:23.980
Okay!

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:28.330
I see. So Vivio's group is entering the Inter-Middle.

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:31.700
Looks like that Hegemon girl, Einhart, is entering, too.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:36.200
Isn't one of the sisters entering?
You know, your top pupil?

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.620
You mean Chantez?

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:40.020
She said she wants to go...

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:44.280
but she has yet to learn the grace
of being a sister and a squire.

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:48.030
Huh? You mean she doesn't have your permission yet?

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:53.560
But when I was running errands earlier,
I sent in her application.

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:56.310
What was that!?

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:00.020
It's too late to get mad!

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:02.690
Representing the Sankt Kaiser Church Headquarters...

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:06.860
Sister Chantez will bring
home the championship!

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:10.460
Ah! Leader!

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:13.890
Is that the tournament application?

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:17.000
Yeah! They're accepting them starting today.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:19.630
You'll win the championship this year for sure!

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:21.790
You were so close last year!

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:24.610
Idiot! That's exactly what bothers her!

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:30.420
Look! Now she's crying!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:35.210
I'll do my best!
This year I won't lose!

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:45.070
Her Majesty, the Sankt Kaiser, turned ten this year.
It appears she'll be participating.

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:48.570
And possibly the Hegemon girl as well.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:53.580
That's good news. If they come,
this should be an excellent opportunity.

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:59.420
Old Belka's strongest champion wasn't the Sankt Kaiser
or Hegemon, but rather the Thunder Emperor Dahlgrun.

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:04.310
I have inherited <i>just a little bit of</i>
the blood of that Thunder Emperor!

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:08.360
Allow Victoria Dahlgrun to
thoroughly demonstrate that!

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:23.980
<i>The trip ended...</i>

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:27.950
<i>and we returned to our normal daily lives...</i>

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:31.910
<i>while beginning our training for the Inter-Middle.</i>

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:40.040
<i>Each with their goals...</i>

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:44.640
<i>Each with their vows...</i>

00:21:47.010 --> 00:21:49.060
The qualifiers are still...

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:52.190
two months away.

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:32.680
Okay, Miura!
Let's see that energy!

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:33.430
Go ahead.

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:35.190
Um... Well...

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:38.140
Next time,
Lyrical Magical, doing my best!

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:39.420
Good!
